### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### Get Current Attendance Status
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/attendance/status
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Clock In
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/attendance/clock-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location": {
        "lat": 10.3157,
        "lng": 123.8854,
        "accuracy": 15
    },
    "deviceInfo": "Chrome on Windows 11"
}

###

### Clock Out
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/attendance/clock-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "location": {
        "lat": 10.3157,
        "lng": 123.8854,
        "accuracy": 10
    },
    "deviceInfo": "Chrome on Windows 11"
}
